A||||2||Matt86Z||Going to look at fieros tomorro, need advice...||||1||
Z||000000||Matt86Z||06-18-2001||05:12 PM||||Ohkay, a buddy of mine has an 84 SE and we're heading to look at 3 cars tomorro. They come as a package, and we're thinking of splitting on them. One runs, he wants the other for some parts, and we're going to scavenge all the good parts we can off the third. any things to look out for? I know the floor is bad in all three, nothing a patch and some rivets can't fix...<P>Any comments?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Urchin||06-18-2001||07:32 PM||||Well, on the topic of rust, being a canadian car.  Check in the corners under the carpet in the engine compartment, and battery tray area.  But if your only using them for parts, then maybe this isnt a concern.  Don't forget about the parts that are often forgotten until you need them: dew strips, headlight motors, weather stiping, etc.  I always forget to look for that stuff.<BR>Good luck<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature2_3.jpg">   <P>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000002||isthiswhereiputausername?||06-18-2001||07:36 PM||||Rustwise? Since I live in PEI, I'm guessing the cars would rust along the same points as the ones here in PEI.<P>Run your hand underneath the floor sills checking for rust,also check by the battery box and underneath the sound insulation on the drivers side (inside engine compartment)<BR>And check for frame rust by grabbing inside the top of the rear fenders..<P>Engine wise? <BR>make sure it runs good, and try to shake the engine by moving the car back and forth in park..this will tell you if you have any bad engine /tranny mounts.<P>Also if your giving it a good going over, I'd recommend checking the front end for play (bushings/bearings,etc)<P>Rear end is pretty easy and cheap to work on since most of the mid-80's FWD parts fit right on (brakes/struts/axles/etc)<P>Accident damage?<P>Check for front end frame damage by looking down around the Rad. and looking for rust spots or places where the paint is flaking..<P>Anyone else have any suggestions for him?<P><BR>||||reg||1
